#. (itstool) path: component/name
#: org.kde.calligra.stage.metainfo.xml:6
msgid "Calligra Stage"
msgstr "Calligra Stage"

#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#: org.kde.calligra.stage.metainfo.xml:7
msgid "Presentation"
msgstr "Prezentacija"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.calligra.stage.metainfo.xml:9
msgid "Calligra Stage is an easy to use yet still flexible presentation application. You can easily create presentations containing a rich variety of elements, from graphics to text, from charts to images. Calligra Stage is extensible through a plugin system, so it is easy to add new effects, new content elements or even new ways of managing your presentation. Because of the integration with Calligra, all the power and flexibility of the Calligra content elements are available to Stage."
msgstr "Calligra Stage jednostavna je, ali fleksibilna aplikacija za izradu prezentacija. Jednostavno možete stvarati prezentacije s raznovrsnim elementima, od grafike i teksta do grafikona i slika. Calligra Stage proširiv je sustavom dodataka, pa je lako dodavati nove efekte, elemente sadržaja ili čak nove načine upravljanja prezentacijom. Zahvaljujući integraciji s Calligrom, Stageu su dostupne sve mogućnosti i fleksibilnost elemenata sadržaja Calligre."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.calligra.stage.metainfo.xml:15
msgid "Features:"
msgstr "Značajke:"

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.calligra.stage.metainfo.xml:17
msgid "Multiple master slides"
msgstr "Više matrica slajdova"

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.calligra.stage.metainfo.xml:18
msgid "Easily switch between slides during a presentation"
msgstr "Jednostavno prebacivanje među slajdovima tijekom prezentacije"

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.calligra.stage.metainfo.xml:19
msgid "Add notes for your slide"
msgstr "Dodavanje bilješki slajdovima"

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.calligra.stage.metainfo.xml:20
msgid "Supports most ODF file transitions"
msgstr "Podržava većinu prijelaza ODF datoteka"

#. (itstool) path: screenshot/caption
#: org.kde.calligra.stage.metainfo.xml:33
msgid "Calligra Stage main window"
msgstr "Glavni prozor Calligre Stage"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.calligra.stage.metainfo.xml:76
msgid "This release add flatpak support to the Calligra Office suite. This also contains some small graphical changes to the slides list and fix the automatic preview of the animations."
msgstr "Ovo izdanje dodaje podršku za Flatpak uredskom paketu Calligra. Uključuje i manje grafičke promjene popisa slajdova te ispravak automatskog pregleda animacija."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.calligra.stage.metainfo.xml:82
msgid "The most significant changes are that Calligra has been fully transitioned to Qt6 and KF6, along with a major overhaul of its user interface."
msgstr "Najznačajnije su promjene potpuni prijelaz Calligre na Qt 6 i KF 6 te temeljita obnova korisničkog sučelja."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.calligra.stage.metainfo.xml:83
msgid "Stage didn’t really change aside of the sidebar redesign. The tooltip for the slides are also now compatible with Wayland."
msgstr "Osim redizajna bočne trake, Stage se nije bitno promijenio. Oblačići pomoći za slajdove sada su kompatibilni i s Waylandom."
